  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/12/IMG_7734.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>La Orkesta Pelillo, con sus particulares versiones de punk-rock, ha llenado la noche de este viernes de buenas vibraciones y de gente el pub D&eacute;cada de Onda. Se ha estrenado como bajista en el grupo Antonio Latorre Nieto y ha habido colaboraciones de Arantxa Prades Irigaray, como es habitual, y de Carlos, de La Gran Chingada.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodecada/img_7689.jpg\" alt=\"img_7689\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodecada/img_7690.jpg\" alt=\"img_7690\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodecada/img_7692.jpg\" alt=\"img_7692\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodecada/img_7695.jpg\" alt=\"img_7695\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodecada/img_7697.jpg\" alt=\"img_7697\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodecada/img_7701.jpg\" alt=\"img_7701\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodecada/img_7704.jpg\" alt=\"img_7704\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodecada/img_7707.jpg\" alt=\"img_7707\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillodecada/img_7708.jpg\" alt=\"img_7708\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src